{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25807","headline":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 · 李绅","name":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽毛似雪无瑕点，顾影秋池舞白云。\n闲整素仪三岛近，回飘清唳九霄闻。\n好风顺举应摩日，逸翮将成莫恋羣。\n凌励坐看空碧外，更怜凫鹭老江濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}